class_name SettingsCatalog
extends RefCounted
## Every setting the manager can edit, whichever file or mechanism stores it:
##   "property" - server.properties key
##   "yaml"     - a key path in bukkit.yml, spigot.yml or Paper's config/*.yml
##   "gamerule" - a game rule, stored in the world and applied through console commands
## Entries are Dictionaries: {id, source, key, [file], [legacy], label, desc, type, category,
## default, [options], [min], [max], [step], [since], [until], [main]}.
## Key paths were verified against files generated by Paper 1.21.11 and 26.3.

